- src/services/newsService.ts :: Stack — newsService imports Stack directly and calls Stack.ContentType().Query() at lines 68, 109-110, 140-141, 157-158. These bypass ContentstackFactory and need livePreviewQuery() applied to include draft content during preview. [existing helper: Stack]
