- src/api/utils/_contentstack_getNewsArticles.ts :: Stack — Directly calls Stack.ContentType(ContentTypes.NewsArticle).Query() at lines 24, 50-51, bypassing ContentstackFactory. Needs livePreviewQuery() for preview support. [existing helper: Stack]

